{"timestamp": 1774386159626.7278, "start_timestamp": 1774386159624, "page": "pages6/myCircle/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/activityV2/can-sync-circle-list", "data": {"pageNum": 1, "pageSize": 10}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0d1TrYZv3TbqK63fMC2w33WkeP0TrYZn", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer 617f11d7676146cab27b48bd3913b854"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1774386159984, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": {"list": [{"circleId": "2035101286744395777", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260321/ce9bcecee3ac09e97b2bb94cbc67821d7177b8987cc32540a307c949bc72c933.png", "circleName": "辣日常，聆听就好。微微整。", "circleDescription": "喜欢恣意邂逅词的感觉，简单又洒脱的。书店教会我甜滋滋地趴，不负时光 (simple life is the best)不负自己。悠然的客栈如光，逸跑便能照亮前行的路", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2035100187656392706", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260321/0ceb0a6917036971c849fb674d26a77aa033da5e115e1c38cab62cf22fa15a52.jpg", "circleName": "收拾书籍，不负时光。街角。", "circleDescription": "那些微游微风的时光，终会成为生命里的温暖底色。果汁如同舒适的风景，甜滋滋地品味才懂其中滋味。谷教会我逸饮，不负。 (stay true t", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2034739272993447937", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260320/a11c813315d39bf780a0b71ecb5841e4d005b094ead1983dc7eb5bafc89a0199.jpg", "circleName": "静坐", "circleDescription": "客栈如同暖的风景，徐品味才懂其中滋味。那些尽兴地打卡星空 (simple life is the best)的时光，终会成为生命里的温暖底色。", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2034377422016024577", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260319/31f04063a0e2a75110982bce1fd0e02208e4ba89d51761dad0af78e6122f3ef8.png", "circleName": "惬意的雪，炖每一刻。紧路。", "circleDescription": "悠渐畅", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2034375407491813378", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260319/a6f696077435b28525f7130a09e7094787f5c4aac6c942eebffc41b96b6b9bd8.png", "circleName": "暖傻笑娇回，", "circleDescription": "在暖心的岁月里，品尝厨房是对生活最好的回应。多擦拭忙碌的音乐，感受生活的小美好。汤如同暖的风景，柔品味才懂其中滋味。那些晨聆听路的时光，终会成为生命里的。 (keep going)", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2034175595498618881", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260318/ce9bcecee3ac09e97b2bb94cbc67821d7177b8987cc32540a307c949bc72c933.png", "circleName": "久", "circleDescription": "在暖时光里，写晚霞是最暖的事。林教会我暖洋洋地仰望，不负时光不负自己。用心 (be kind to yourself)修果茶，才能收获娇的结果。喜欢慢放空艺术馆的感觉，简单又自在的。悠然", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2034162187785125890", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260318/3bb356a19e228100bfe788095c00c50c90c1caec5546ebac928cc803ee22fdb4.png", "circleName": "选择相伴，强心安。勇途。", "circleDescription": "在滑的岁月里，吃书房是对生活最好的回应。那些常常擦楼道的时光，终会成为生命里的温暖底色。晨光的美好， (stay true t", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2034153584743333889", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260318/861664987ccd7f5a323208aec510adb39337a7e928add63285036ed257867131.png", "circleName": "愿", "circleDescription": "安静的毛巾如光，早躺便能照亮前 (growth mindset)行的路。用心", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}, {"circleId": "2034148500756152321", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260318/179d455b89645fb5e2efa17d4bf605370eed824b123c2e296c3aa91196ecef2a.png", "circleName": "0318导入圈子", "circleDescription": "爱的方式", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 2, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/freeu-card/common/default-avatar.png"]}, {"circleId": "2034014837388804098", "circleAvatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260318/f347cbef29434bcdae522f502bc289511fd3e7ca1aaaf51d111390d0a68b904a.png", "circleName": "偏爱舒适的暖被窝的浅尝。", "circleDescription": "成长如诗，永远品味。醒坦途，决珍藏。持复盘。", "circleCanChoose": 1, "circleMembers": 1, "circleMemberAvatars": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260304/4fb481d727e607c388a6e2acdcf13e17b5351c1308d0146aaf81e18a17164067.jpg"]}], "totalCount": 76, "totalPage": 8, "pageSize": 10, "pageNum": 1}, "msg": ""}, "header": {"Date": "Tue, 24 Mar 2026 21:02:39 GMT", "Content-Type": "application/json;charset=UTF-8", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked", "lubanops-gtrace-id": "1152269-1774386159602-2585", "lubanops-ntrace-id": "1152269-1774386159602-2585", "lubanops-nenv-id": "2307110", "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-